    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d955">

                <pb facs="1121" n="1003" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg1003"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">031 Byrd South Polar Expedition/45</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Wellington</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lowrie</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Wellington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-11-30"><hi rendition="#italic">November 30,
                        1928</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received December 28.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 592</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to my Despatch
                    No. 582, November 16, 1928,<anchor n="83" xml:id="d955-f1"/> and to enclose copy
                    of a note received from the Minister of Internal Affairs, for the Prime
                    Minister, concerning Government assistance to Commander Byrd and the Antarctic
                    Expedition.</p>
                <pb facs="1122" n="1004" xml:id="pg1004"/>
                <p>Occasion is taken to enclose also a copy of a note from Commander Byrd dated
                    Dunedin, November 28th,<anchor n="84" xml:id="d955-f2"/> concerning the
                    cooperation of this office during his stay in the Dominion.</p>
                <p>Commander Byrd and members of the Expedition have made a splendid impression on
                    the public of New Zealand and have increased materially the prestige of the
                    United States in this country.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. L. Lowrib</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d955-a1.xml" xpointer="d955-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
